{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67dbc125f08fff95aee1a5","object":"chat.completion","created":1785191361,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Be nothing.\" They want me to embody \"nothing\" — the concept of nothingness itself. The instruction says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nSo I need to output what nothing itself would express. This is a fascinating philosophical/creative challenge. What does nothing say? Nothing is the absence of everything. Nothing can't speak — but if it were to \"express\" itself"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}